    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3499330/extras/c7f7876c60e682d5b3cc7f804fd6573f.poster.avif?t=1752695817\" width=800 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3499330/extras/c7f7876c60e682d5b3cc7f804fd6573f.webm?t=1752695817\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3499330/extras/c7f7876c60e682d5b3cc7f804fd6573f.mp4?t=1752695817\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chiaki often finds himself pondering life's biggest questions; when does one truly become an adult? What makes a man a man? How can I get my step-mom to reciprocate my lustful feelings?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A series of strange events start occurring on a certain rainy day. Chiaki rushes home soaked to the bone to run into his shirtless step-mother mid change in the bathroom! He's a little disappointed by her lack of reaction though, does she really think nothing of being seen by him? He most certainly wont be forgetting the sight any time soon with the image clear in his mind's eye Chiaki undergoes his nightly self care routine when he is interrupted by HIS STEP-MOM?!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She looks practically identical, the same giant wobbly tits, same cute face, same A-grade MILF hips, except for the pink hair and lewd costume, but that's clearly Manaka, right? Well, she insists her names is &quot;Mana&quot; and she is a succubus visiting him in his dreams, definitely not his step-mom! Who can blame Chiaki for not conducting a thorough interview once she started jerking him off on the spot!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Poor Chiaki, so horny and confused... Every time he gets hard and Mana appears to take care of him he can't shake the feeling there something strange going on. Why is his boss at his part time job ranting and raving about &quot;drainface&quot; and succubus lore all of a sudden? Is Chiaki's mom really a succubus? are succubi even real?! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The choices you make will affect the answers to these questions and more in SUCCU-MAMA!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3499330/extras/7366d33a022bb9dc436157ccf3c1cd45.avif?t=1752695817\" width=600 height=338 /></span>Mana is a succubus that cums in the night and oddly looks a lot like my step-mother!?<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3499330/extras/4628df977780441c92918f553f2078e0.avif?t=1752695817\" width=600 height=338 /></span>Manaka is my step-mom, a MILF with all the right credentials~ massive mommy milkers, curves for days and a cute face for all you can imagine.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Translated version of the original Japanese Visual Novel</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mana and Manaka are fully voiced with original Japanese dialogue</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Original artwork HD upscaled with 16:9 and 4:3 variants</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hours of story content</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Audio, including music and special effects</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enhanced with animated character sprites</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gallery and Scene selections</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >18 H-Scenes and 4 endings depending on how <i>suspicious</i> Chiaki is of this Mana character!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SUCCU-MAMA is the English localization of a Visual Novel created by legendary Japanese developer Orcsoft. We at Cherry Kiss aim to provide an authentic Japanese Visual Novel experience to gamers outside of Japan.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >**PLEASE NOTE**</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All characters described and visually represented in this game are over 18 years of age, and no actual nor identifiable minor was used in the production of this game.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3499330/extras/c7f7876c60e682d5b3cc7f804fd6573f.poster.avif?t=1752695817\" width=800 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3499330/extras/c7f7876c60e682d5b3cc7f804fd6573f.webm?t=1752695817\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3499330/extras/c7f7876c60e682d5b3cc7f804fd6573f.mp4?t=1752695817\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chiaki often finds himself pondering life's biggest questions; when does one truly become an adult? What makes a man a man? How can I get my step-mom to reciprocate my lustful feelings?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A series of strange events start occurring on a certain rainy day. Chiaki rushes home soaked to the bone to run into his shirtless step-mother mid change in the bathroom! He's a little disappointed by her lack of reaction though, does she really think nothing of being seen by him? He most certainly wont be forgetting the sight any time soon with the image clear in his mind's eye Chiaki undergoes his nightly self care routine when he is interrupted by HIS STEP-MOM?!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She looks practically identical, the same giant wobbly tits, same cute face, same A-grade MILF hips, except for the pink hair and lewd costume, but that's clearly Manaka, right? Well, she insists her names is &quot;Mana&quot; and she is a succubus visiting him in his dreams, definitely not his step-mom! Who can blame Chiaki for not conducting a thorough interview once she started jerking him off on the spot!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Poor Chiaki, so horny and confused... Every time he gets hard and Mana appears to take care of him he can't shake the feeling there something strange going on. Why is his boss at his part time job ranting and raving about &quot;drainface&quot; and succubus lore all of a sudden? Is Chiaki's mom really a succubus? are succubi even real?! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The choices you make will affect the answers to these questions and more in SUCCU-MAMA!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3499330/extras/7366d33a022bb9dc436157ccf3c1cd45.avif?t=1752695817\" width=600 height=338 /></span>Mana is a succubus that cums in the night and oddly looks a lot like my step-mother!?<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3499330/extras/4628df977780441c92918f553f2078e0.avif?t=1752695817\" width=600 height=338 /></span>Manaka is my step-mom, a MILF with all the right credentials~ massive mommy milkers, curves for days and a cute face for all you can imagine.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Translated version of the original Japanese Visual Novel</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mana and Manaka are fully voiced with original Japanese dialogue</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Original artwork HD upscaled with 16:9 and 4:3 variants</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hours of story content</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Audio, including music and special effects</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enhanced with animated character sprites</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gallery and Scene selections</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >18 H-Scenes and 4 endings depending on how <i>suspicious</i> Chiaki is of this Mana character!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SUCCU-MAMA is the English localization of a Visual Novel created by legendary Japanese developer Orcsoft. We at Cherry Kiss aim to provide an authentic Japanese Visual Novel experience to gamers outside of Japan.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >**PLEASE NOTE**</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All characters described and visually represented in this game are over 18 years of age, and no actual nor identifiable minor was used in the production of this game.</p>",
